Description: A benchmark and record-keeping snapshot derived from the
    'stringr' package. It contains a separate 'stringi'-derived backend that
    reads and returns 'ALTREP' character vectors through 'charport'. An R
    switch routes operations either to installed 'stringi' or to the separate
    translated backend. This package records the mechanical translation and
    is not intended as a complete replacement for 'stringr' or 'stringi'.
